{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a76e6d0114d60b0261c5c1787045c74ee40bacdf7eb63aca16b2ec63302416e4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f777487faeef021cd4cc9a8cbce51721f19ed4453f7d33fa02e37404e09d395",
      "text": "啊，●●●●●●●●●●P酱，\n演出辛苦啦。那边的收尾工作还要很久吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b85ef6c810ab5dd5d500601978380b0c298afb790b061c36b213c628ca293afa",
      "text": "大家不是约好了要一起确认今天的录像吗？\n是不是再等一会儿比较好呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3be0855b355cf44c0d5989845de1121599f5975f150a8b6b5d1c99a1d81de369",
      "text": "马上就到\n休息室了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eb0c568b15bd69ab2d5786b9cf03274637e767969b9a3e472752789053c6be0",
      "text": "啊，工作已经结束了呀。太好了。\n他们两个也都很想听听P酱的意见呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec66de57613b2835708960bc52e707d6c4d69d326d162ff0e00928b967f832c",
      "text": "感觉如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69e33ccfe14499775c310786db93c797548733007ca4d7d4a1c932389f704571",
      "text": "我也想听听\n百百人先生的感想",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07eebec172605749f317782fdb6421e1098963b8c2804ca6c7f7237c6770157f",
      "text": "嗯……这样啊，多亏了正式演出时的舞台效果，感觉比排练时更能表现出作品的世界观了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cc2ef2d45a6dcb5fc47d787caee88f7a07d455ec74b7a66e605c011b83cbc5c",
      "text": "而且天峰君他，\n一直在休息室里笑眯眯的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e76ec82d022621e456922e31262ba358e2d2a30ab01ba196553f463ed6d408e2",
      "text": "这就说明即便从原作游戏粉丝的视角来看，\n我们的表现也是过关的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_b:2_4_048_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b904f86b7b54877254542cbcef3656582eec9b5d3e2221f8f52973c0fde98501",
      "text": "我也很想知道你的感想呢。\n我们都在等着你，快点回来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
